			<div class="content" id="post-content-4835715">
									

<p>A species of termites who are capable of collecting an manipulating metals. They form a complex society with trade, hierarchy and art.</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up extra space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) and titles short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p>Here it is! Got the first Greenlight in May and now its December and I finally got a first draft done.<br />
This is my first SCP and I'm really happy with how its turned out so far.</p>
<p><strong>SCP-XXXX</strong>: Thermites<br />
<strong>Word Count</strong>: 3,823<br />
<strong>Greenlit post:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13365263/scp-idea:thermites">http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13365263/scp-idea:thermites</a><br />
<strong>Draft:</strong> <a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/cloudncali">http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/cloudncali</a></p>
<p>Looking forward to what the community thinks.</p>
<p>This article started as a silly twist on the word thermite (the pyrotechnic powder) actually being Thermal Termites. The narrative developed from my fondness of SCPs with more human elements. The SCP Foundation is full of people from different backgrounds, its always fun to see different personalities show through the cold and stiff atmosphere of the foundation.</p>
<p>Edit: Massive rework of grammar and prose. Should be easier to read now.</p>

